            <pre class="code-block"><button class="copy" title="Copy" data-bs-toggle="tooltip"><i class="far fa-copy"></i></button><code>brainflayer -v -b all.blf -f all.bin -c uce -t priv -x -i private_keys.txt</code></pre>

            <p>Check private keys in HEX format generated by a Python script:</p>

            <pre class="code-block"><button class="copy" title="Copy" data-bs-toggle="tooltip"><i class="far fa-copy"></i></button><code>python3 ./private_keys.py | brainflayer -v -b all.blf -f all.bin -c uce -t priv -x</code></pre>

